  "solution": {
    "text": "Norethindrone is an example of synthetic progesterone derivative most widely used as antifertility drug. Meprobamate, is&nbsp;relatively mild tranquilizer&nbsp;suitable for relieving tension.&nbsp;Synthetic drugs, brompheniramine (Dimetapp) and terfenadine (Seldane), act as antihistamines.&nbsp;Ampicillin and Amoxycillin are synthetic modifications of penicillins. These have broad spectrum&nbsp;antibiotics.",
